he cloud storage bucket  I see and how would I deploy a new  version of this function here well let's  edit this and retry so open Cloud editor  in your project  then navigate to function.go in the  folder code function  go to the line that executes the convert  command  change x 100 which means the thumbnail  is 100 by 100 pixels to something else  let's say X 75.  now save the file  now go back to the cloud shell and type  terraform apply and rerun the script  all done  very good I'll hit the URL again I'll  upload a new file here  uh-huh  and there it is 75 by 75 pixels  excellent thanks for showing me your app  Terry and thank you everyone for  watching use Terry's app as a template  to build your own app that handles  uploaded files  if you have any questions for Tara me or  serverless topic suggestions for future  episodes please add them in the comments  we read every single one until next time  [Music]

